      "document_revision": "sha256:chapter-002-rev-002",
      "fragment_ordinal": 4,
      "quote_hash": "860c976917a26dc03f5b1773cf11c63ce939c6c91d8a075f6a435f80487fdfda",
      "excerpt": "顾宁摇头：沈砚只是走私客，不可能与王室有关。"
    },
    {
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "source_ref_id": "30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "document_id": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "chapter_id": "10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "document_revision": "sha256:chapter-004-rev-001",
      "fragment_ordinal": 2,
      "quote_hash": "c6b7b0514c7901c2cc3359b112585648460f2cddf020418a05dfd95ff91183dd",
      "excerpt": "火灾发生在十年前，幼年的萧砚被管家从北塔暗道救走。"
    },
    {
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "source_ref_id": "30000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "document_id": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "chapter_id": "10000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "document_revision": "sha256:chapter-003-rev-005",
      "fragment_ordinal": 9,
      "quote_hash": "02b43894c69c9431cca77c62228fea0b7d2908b8664ab556c1b8d1eb1f4fa28d",
      "excerpt": "顾宁终于认出银戒内侧的王室铭文，明白自己一直错了。"
    }
  ],
